    "description": {
      "value": "You focus your malevolent gaze on a target, causing their heart to seize in dread. The target must attempt a Fortitude saving throw. Regardless of the result, the target is temporarily immune to further castings of curse of death for 1 day.\n\nCritical Success: The target is unaffected.\nSuccess: The target is afflicted with the curse of death at stage 1, and the stage of the curse can't increase beyond stage 1.\nFailure: The target is afflicted with the curse of death at stage 1.\nCritical Failure: The target is afflicted with the curse of death at stage 2."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): Increase the negative damage taken on a success and during the first three stages of the curse by 1d6."
    },
